    "ExplanationWrongC": "Net income divided by assets is Return on Assets (ROA), not the asset turnover ratio. Asset turnover specifically measures the revenue-generating efficiency of assets using Sales in the numerator. ROA is the product of profit margin and asset turnover, not a substitute for either component individually.",
