    "Stem": "The CEO of Northstar Industries publicly emphasizes that meeting quarterly earnings targets is the organization's highest priority and that 'results justify the approach.' Middle managers observe that employees who meet targets receive promotions regardless of compliance concerns. Under the COSO framework, which component of internal control is most directly weakened by this environment?",
