    "Stem": "Westlake Supply Company is restructuring its accounts payable department. The department manager proposes assigning each clerk full responsibility for a specific vendor set — including receiving vendor invoices, entering invoices into the system, preparing checks for those invoices, and reconciling the related vendor statements. Which internal control principle does this assignment violate?",
