    "Stem": "Pacific Rim Trading Company assessed its foreign exchange (FX) risk and determined that without any controls, potential FX losses could reach $2.5 million annually. After implementing a hedging program and dual-approval requirements for foreign currency transactions, management estimates that residual FX exposure is approximately $400,000 annually. The $2.5 million figure represents:",
